				"usage": "Attention banner text on its own surface"
			}
		],
		"exempt": [
			{
				"token": "border_decorative",
				"reason": "Purely decorative separation between surfaces. It is never the only way to identify a control, so WCAG does not require 3:1 for it; border_control carries that role and is tested."
			},
			{
				"token": "warning_border",
				"reason": "Decorative edge of the attention banner, never the only way the state is identified: the banner's own text carries it, its subtle surface separates it from the page, and that text-on-surface pair is measured above. It is the warning counterpart of border_decorative, which carries the same decision."
			}
		]
	}
